  "details": "- CVE-2026-91403: Distrust the compromised eMudhra intermediate CA certificates\n- Require the java-21-openjdk-portable BuildRequires at or above the matching\n  .tuxcare.elsN revision built for this target, so this package is built\n  against a portable build that carries the backported fix rather than an\n  unpatched one\n- Glob the portable archive names, which now carry the .tuxcare.elsN revision,\n  so %build can still untar the portable tarballs\n- Derive the debugedit build path from the extracted portable tarball's own\n  top-level directory, so the source paths in the debuginfo still match the\n  portable build directory",
